header.gc-header-standard.gc-header-login
  .container
    .gc-login-form-wrapper.col-sm-6.cal-xs-12
      h1.text-center
        | Invite Your Trainer
      form.gc-signup-form(role="form")
        ul.gc-signup-checkbox-wrapper.row
          li.col-xs-6
            label.gc-signup-checkbox.gc-have-trainer-icon
              span
                | I already have
                br
                | a Trainer
              input(type='radio', checked='', name='account_type', value='1')
          li.col-xs-6
            label.gc-signup-checkbox.gc-not-have-trainer-icon.active
              span
                | I don't have
                br
                | a Trainer
              input(type='radio', name='account_type', value='3')
        .row.gc-trainer-invite-title
          | Enter you trainer's email to invite him.
        .form-group.gc-email-form-group
          label(for="gc-invite-trainer")
            | You Trainer's Email
          input.form-control(
            type="text"
            id="gc-invite-trainer"
            name="first_name"
            placeholder=""
            data-bind="first_name"
            autofocus
          )
          label.gc-error-message
        .row.form-group.text-center
            button.btn.btn-default.gc-invite-btn(type="submit")
              | Send Invitation
      p.gc-login-signup-wrapper.text-center
        | Have a Gymcloud account? 
        a(href='#login')
          | Sign In
